               the city guide is written by expert authors and includes a handy
               pull-out map. Key features: --Detailed street maps for each area
               of the city --Top 20 list of the must-see highlights
               --Itineraries to help you plan your visit --Reviews of
               restaurants, bars and shops, selected by our expert authors.
               In-depth analysis of the city's history, design, architecture and
